unner_error_codes_f75f_heldout.py:1-16` — Preserve the type-discriminated error-code contract and observable surfaces. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_operation_snapshot_authoritative_binding.py:1-27,222-228,278-282,313-319` — Preserve authoritative reuse, frozen resolution, overrides, and the live push-mode carve-out. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_operation_snapshot_surfaces.py:1-27,74-109,176-182,190-212` — Preserve real-entry-point coverage and absolute anchoring. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_budget.py:1-14,70-74` — Preserve current floor and operator-budget precedence. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_ops_characterization.py:1-11` — Preserve the characterized public return shape and companion coverage locations. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_workflow_error_codes_35ab.py:1-16` — Preserve unknown-step classification and the observable classifier/dispatch checks. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/contracts/test_cli_help_writing_guidelines_jerboa.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_completion_budget.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_error_code_taxonomy_contract.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_llm_config_authoritative_binding.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_llmrunner_error_codes_f75f_heldout.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_operation_snapshot_authoritative_binding.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_operation_snapshot_surfaces.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_budget.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_ops_characterization.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_workflow_error_codes_35ab.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_cli_help_writing_guidelines_jerboa.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_completion_budget.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_error_code_taxonomy_contract.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_llm_config_authoritative_binding.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_llmrunner_error_codes_f75f_heldout.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_operation_snapshot_authoritative_binding.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_operation_snapshot_surfaces.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_budget.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while pr